                    {
                        id make-upstream-clean-worktree
                        title "Run GNU Make discovery from a clean disposable worktree"
                        priority 0
                        kind @test
                        sealed true
                        log (
                            {
                                at 2026-08-08T22:34:10.887883343Z
                                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                                kind @decision
                                text "The discovery driver mutates its working tree and failed cases leave outputs behind. Reusing reference/gnumake/tests made subsequent runs observe stale targets: tests/foo.q suppressed one target-variable recipe and ignored tests/xxx.o turned a missing-rule case into no work. A clean detached GNU Make 4.4.1 worktree moved 28 of 1,349 inventory rows and changed class totals from 614/74/112/549 to 606/74/110/559 (unclassified/compiler/interface/narration). Run every discovery pass in a disposable checkout at the pinned commit; generate config-flags.pm there, classify that work directory, and remove the checkout afterward. Never clean the user's persistent reference checkout."
                            }

                            {
