                        text "Done, closing retroactively after review — the work landed 2026-08-06 as e10225a but no note was recorded. The commit corrected this node's premise: behaviour only matched GNU Make because every `.x.y:` target was treated as a suffix rule regardless of .SUFFIXES, so the declared suffix list is now read in order rather than the warning merely deleted. Test make_mode_reads_the_declared_suffix_list in tests/cli.rs. 19 cases moved."
