                kind @note
                text "Filed after two independent sightings on 2026-08-09: cli::tests::rust_cli_rebuilds_and_reloads_manifest_before_targets fails with MissingInput on its own template file under load (both failures immediately after a full recompile; 0 in 22 warm-cache runs across two branches). The test separates two manifest mtimes with a 20 ms sleep in src/cli.rs, which load can eat. Fix the mechanism, not the number: write the mtimes explicitly (filetime-style) or stat-loop until the clock has visibly advanced, rather than sleeping and hoping."
